Convert all7 direct helper producers. Distinguish missing chainstate directory, missing hash file and read/write/close stages; retain original Info warning prose, recovery instruction, path conversions, optional/hash return values and disk behavior. Support adjustment adds Directory distinct from primary file Path; no new consensus, migration or hash-content logging.

Manual native control invokes actual ReadSnapshotBaseBlockhash for absent directory/file and valid hash with trailing bytes, checking typed paths/text and the unchanged successful hash return after a warning. Source event lint393/diff checks pass. Native execution remains pending next combined gate;171 checkpoint stays immutable.

Coordinator ordered integration (2026-10-20):
Existing causal fixes and mechanical namespace/format adaptations are folded at their first responsible owner. Exact inputs and prefix adaptations are recorded in integration-next final delivery; original author provenance is retained.
